State Fair\n\nWe all know that the Minnesota State Fair got canceled last year and the cravings for all those fair foods are going wild!  No need to worry, you don’t have to wait until August to enjoy all that good food.  The Kick Off to Summer event at the fair is helping to satisfy those cravings… Read More\n\nYoung entrepreneur scores big with state fair booth\n\n  Let’s get one thing straight right off the bat … shave ice is not a snow cone. And yes, it’s shave ice, not shaved ice. That was the lesson being taught by Jason Giandalia, proprietor of Minnesnowii Shave Ice, one of the food sensations at festivals throughout the state including the upcoming Minnesota State… Read More\n\nMN State Fair reveals new foods for 2018\n\n  The annual list of new foods to be offered at the Minnesota State Fair is one of the most anticipated announcements of the calendar year. https://www.kare11.com/article/entertainment/events/minnesota-state-fair/mn-state-fair-reveals-new-foods-for-2018/89-565551431… Read More\n\n5 Most Insane New State Fair Foods\n\nThis one has potential, Hawaiian Shave Ice at the State Fair! A sweet, spicy blend could be good. A world’s worth of sweet treats are all tossed in this cold dessert dish: Mango-flavored shave ice is topped with salty/sour/sweet Mexican chamoy, hit with tart-hot tajin chili powder, with mango boba pearls and a lily-gilding tamarind… Read More\n\npaging-navigation\n1\n2\nDAYS\n0\n0\n0\nHOURS\n0\n0\nMINUTES\n0\n0\nSECONDS\n0\n0\nJoin us at the MN State Fair!\n\n\nAcross from the GIANT SLIDE!\n\n\n\n6100 Mccoll Dr Unit 381\nSavage MN\nBook Us Today!\n(952) 486-0079\n  \nEvent and Party Catering\nFun With Shave Ice\nIn The Media\nBlog\nJobs\nRochester\nHome\n\n\n\n© 2026 Minnesnowii. All rights reserved. Favicon by Flaticon. Site design by Stargazer LLC.","links":["tel:9524860079","https://www.facebook.com/MinneSnowii/","https://twitter.com/Minnesnowii","https://www.instagram.com/minnesnowii/","https://minnesnowii.com/category/in-th